    "reviews": "\u201cIt takes a bit to grab you but once it does, it's a lot of fun.\u201d<br />\r\nNorthernlion<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cDo you like autobattlers? Did you enjoy Monster Train? If the answer of both of those is yes, then you will altogether likely enjoy this game.\u201d<br />\r\nSplattercat<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cThis is one of those I would say must have roguelikes as far as I'm concerned\u201d<br />\r\nWanderbot<br />\r\n",
